# Deny by default: the working directory also holds the Linux/U-Boot/TF-A/Mesa source
# trees, build output and data pulled off the device (firmware blobs, eMMC/RAM dumps, the
# vendor kernel), which must never be committed (see "What's not in this repo" in the
# README). Only the reviewed paths below are tracked.
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE

!docs/
!docs/**
!patches/
!patches/**
!rootfs/
!rootfs/**
!tests/
!tests/**
!vendor-notes/
!vendor-notes/**

# image/ is also the place generated images end up in older checkouts: scripts only.
!image/
!image/*.sh
!image/extlinux.conf

# tools/ also holds local experiments: listed one by one.
!tools/
!tools/backup_restore/
!tools/backup_restore/**
!tools/bt/
!tools/bt/*.c
!tools/bt/*.sh
!tools/padview/
!tools/padview/**
!tools/gpu/
!tools/gpu/*.c
!tools/gpu/*.sh
!tools/gpu/*.vert
!tools/gpu/*.frag
!tools/gpu/*.comp
!tools/gpu/*.py
!tools/gpu/*.txt
!tools/devmem.c
!tools/drmtest.c
!tools/i2creg.c
!tools/regsnap.c
!tools/ncm_gadget.sh
!tools/test_gadget.sh
!tools/rainbow.sh
!tools/reboot_loop.sh
!tools/push_kernel.sh
!tools/uart_session.py
!tools/uart_push.py
!tools/uboot_test_boot.py
!tools/fnb58_read.py
!tools/fnb58_logger.py
!tools/install_fnb58_udev_rule.sh
